   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Figure 1 uses undefined notation; caption should contain needed information.",
   "minor": true
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.4",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "No explanation of why this was not already done or which failure mode is addressed.",
