   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Theorem 2 merely restates the data processing inequality and is unused.",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.12",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Missing related information-theoretic pruning work (Dai VIB, Isik, Battiti).",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
