   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Exact MI equality requirement too strong and not what is actually implemented.",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "P1.14",
   "reviewer": "P1",
   "text": "Implemented method seems to be ordinary layerwise reconstruction-loss pruning like other methods.",
